WEBVTT

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:02.180
Satou Kazuma!

00:00:02.530 --> 00:00:06.150
When we looked into the source of 
the monsters all around the town,

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:07.850
we found them to be coming from

00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:10.190
the Keele Dungeon that
you entered the other day!

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:13.150
You can't just blame everything on us.

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:16.240
I'll ask, just in case. You guys don't 
know anything about this, right?

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:20.370
It means nothing to me, unless it has 
something to do with explosion magic.

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:21.840
Same goes for me.

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:24.750
I haven't done anything 
likely to cause a problem.

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:26.060
And you?

00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:27.930
Of course not!

00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:30.500
You're doubting me way too much!

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:34.840
If anything, there should be fewer 
monsters in that dungeon because of me!

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:36.970
<i>"Because of me"?</i>

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:38.840
Get over here.

00:00:39.790 --> 00:00:40.690
Keep talking.

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:42.190
Well, y'see...

00:00:42.190 --> 00:00:42.870
Uh-huh.

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:46.290
The magic circle I drew in that lich's 
room was a super serious effort!

00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:46.640
Yeah?

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:50.940
It should still be intact, with any evil 
entities being unable to approach it.

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:52.790
What did you just say?

00:00:52.790 --> 00:00:55.530
Wh-What's the big deal? It's like I just said.

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:59.620
The magic circle I put my best effort into 
should be keeping monsters away from—

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:03.950
You idiot!

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:08.500
<b>Episode 5  Servitude for This Masked Knight!</b>

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:09.700
It shouldn't be my fault...

00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:11.130
It's like this every time.

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:13.190
Do you have some disease 
where you'll freak out if

00:01:13.190 --> 00:01:14.970
you don't negate every 
contribution you make?

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:16.650
The monsters aside,

00:01:16.650 --> 00:01:19.290
we can't just stand by if the 
townsfolk are in trouble.

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:20.850
Please let us help.

00:01:20.970 --> 00:01:22.610
I managed to get her off our case,

00:01:21.730 --> 00:01:23.750
It can't be my fault...

00:01:22.610 --> 00:01:24.220
but if we don't erase that magic circle...

00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:33.980
I see.

00:01:34.550 --> 00:01:36.600
Yeah, those are some strange monsters.

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:37.610
Satou-san.

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:37.610
Satou here.

00:01:38.210 --> 00:01:39.760
I appreciate your cooperation.

00:01:40.220 --> 00:01:43.740
It seems like someone must be 
summoning these monsters...

00:01:44.180 --> 00:01:48.080
So please defeat the spell caster, 
and place this on the summoning circle.

00:01:49.070 --> 00:01:50.580
It's a powerful sealing talisman.

00:01:50.860 --> 00:01:55.040
Something about the mask on those dolls 
disgusts me on an instinctive level.

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:58.720
I wonder what it is... 
It's seriously ticking me off.

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:00.590
Huh? Wha...

00:02:00.590 --> 00:02:02.160
Wh-What?

00:02:02.770 --> 00:02:04.220
Wait... Huh?

00:02:04.450 --> 00:02:06.730
What is this? Does it want attention?

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:09.680
Looking at the mask still ticks me off,

00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:11.770
but somehow, it's starting to look kinda cute—

00:02:15.670 --> 00:02:16.770
As you can see,

00:02:16.770 --> 00:02:20.370
these monsters have a tendency to 
grab someone and then explode.

00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:21.700
I see.

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:24.140
Why are you so calm about this?!

00:02:31.720 --> 00:02:32.430
Right.

00:02:32.950 --> 00:02:35.690
I'll take the lead to clear the way.

00:02:35.690 --> 00:02:37.380
Kazuma, stay behind me.

00:02:37.560 --> 00:02:38.780
R-Right.

00:02:38.780 --> 00:02:39.990
Kazuma, Kazuma.

00:02:40.290 --> 00:02:43.470
I'll just get in the way, 
so I'll wait out here...

00:02:43.470 --> 00:02:44.710
Then I'll join you.

00:02:44.710 --> 00:02:46.530
Hey, you're coming with us!

00:02:47.150 --> 00:02:48.880
No!

00:02:48.880 --> 00:02:50.640
I've had enough of dungeons!

00:02:51.170 --> 00:02:53.980
If I go in, I'll be left behind again!

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:57.900
No dungeons... No...

00:02:58.270 --> 00:03:00.880
I guess it's just me and Darkness, then.

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:02.160
Just Kazuma and me?!

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:05.780
You seem like a greater 
danger than the monsters...

00:03:06.270 --> 00:03:08.450
I could just leave you in the dungeon

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:11.290
so you can experience 
the same trauma as Aqua.

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:14.290
<b>Exploration Quest</b>

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:14.290
<b>Investigate the Strange Activity
in Keele's Dungeon</b>

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:20.140
<i>Unlike the last time I was down here, 
the place was lit up like it was inhabited.</i>

00:03:20.140 --> 00:03:23.300
<i>Could this be because of 
these strange monsters?</i>

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:26.700
I can hit them!

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:28.080
I can actually hit them!

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:29.100
Look, Kazuma!

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:31.560
I can actually hit them with my sword!

00:03:31.800 --> 00:03:34.050
You sure do look happy.

00:03:34.050 --> 00:03:36.130
<i>But with these other guys around,</i>

00:03:36.130 --> 00:03:38.330
<i>I can't erase Aqua's magic circle 
without anyone noticing...</i>

00:03:38.330 --> 00:03:41.320
Hey, wait up! Can we slow down a—

00:03:41.540 --> 00:03:44.320
It got me! Somebody get this thing off me!

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:46.280
No! Stay back!

00:03:47.840 --> 00:03:49.980
Now, Darkness! Let's get moving!

00:03:49.980 --> 00:03:50.700
Leave it to me!

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:53.540
What is this sense of fulfillment?!

00:03:54.440 --> 00:03:58.710
It feels like I'm doing my duty as a 
crusader correctly for the first time!

00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:00.210
KONOSUBA!

00:04:02.210 --> 00:04:03.720
What's his deal?

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:09.470
It seems pretty clear that he's 
the master of those dolls.

00:04:10.670 --> 00:04:11.850
Wha— Hey!

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:14.280
You're the one behind this?

00:04:17.510 --> 00:04:20.510
I didn't expect you to make it this far.

00:04:21.250 --> 00:04:24.480
Welcome to my dungeon, adventurers!

00:04:24.480 --> 00:04:27.490
I am the root of this evil, 
the source of your problems!

00:04:28.010 --> 00:04:29.710
A commander in the Devil King's army,

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:32.400
and a duke of hell who 
leads an army of demons...

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:35.600
The archdemon whose sight 
pierces all in this world...

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:38.500
I am Vanir.

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:42.130
<b>Emergency Quest</b>

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:42.130
<b>Defeat the Devil King Army Commander
Archdemon Vanir</b>

00:04:42.460 --> 00:04:44.160
<i>One of the Devil King's commanders?!</i>

00:04:44.690 --> 00:04:46.230
Hey, we need to run!

00:04:46.230 --> 00:04:49.930
A servant of the goddess Eris 
cannot flee in the face of a demon!

00:04:51.550 --> 00:04:53.500
You'd challenge me, Vanir-san,

00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:56.140
who is rumored to be even more 
powerful than the Devil King?

00:04:57.580 --> 00:04:59.320
Well, just calm yourselves.

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:01.480
I may be one of the Devil King's commanders,

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:03.800
but all I do is maintain the 
barrier around his castle.

00:05:03.800 --> 00:05:05.570
A commander in name only, if you will.

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:09.330
I was asked by the Devil King to 
look into what became of Verdia.

00:05:11.980 --> 00:05:16.450
While I was in Axel, I decided to 
drop in on the knucklehead shopkeeper

00:05:16.450 --> 00:05:20.830
who seems to have a strange talent for 
losing more money the harder she works.

00:05:21.930 --> 00:05:26.020
I am what is commonly known as demonkin...

00:05:26.020 --> 00:05:28.030
And the greatest sustenance for demons

00:05:28.030 --> 00:05:32.050
is the dark emotions you 
humans are so ashamed of!

00:05:32.050 --> 00:05:34.760
With the birth of every new human,

00:05:34.760 --> 00:05:37.900
I run about the garden in joy!

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:40.760
Yet these dolls keep marching 
out of this dungeon,

00:05:40.760 --> 00:05:43.110
giving us humans a pretty hard time!

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:44.200
Truly?

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:47.780
I had intended to use them to 
clear this dungeon of monsters...

00:05:48.940 --> 00:05:53.000
If they've made their way outside, 
there must be no monsters left.

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:54.180
In that case...

00:05:55.900 --> 00:05:58.790
On to my next plan, I suppose.

00:05:59.240 --> 00:06:01.000
What are you after?!

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:05.090
How rude, coming from the man who 
loafed around his room like a bear,

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:08.800
just because he was anxious about 
the armor girl's late return home.

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:10.030
Hey, cut that out!

00:06:10.030 --> 00:06:12.080
How can you say that like you were there?!

00:06:13.270 --> 00:06:14.970
And quit fidgeting, you!

00:06:15.380 --> 00:06:19.230
You see, I have a rather sublime death wish.

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:22.300
First, I obtain a dungeon.

00:06:22.300 --> 00:06:25.480
Then I station demons in each 
room and set up traps.

00:06:25.920 --> 00:06:28.740
A group of skilled adventurers 
rises to the challenge!

00:06:29.130 --> 00:06:31.670
After overcoming taxing trials,

00:06:31.670 --> 00:06:35.010
the brave adventurers make their 
way to the innermost chamber!

00:06:35.010 --> 00:06:37.250
And of course, I am there to greet them!

00:06:37.490 --> 00:06:40.040
"You've done well to make 
it this far, adventurers!"

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:43.250
"Now, defeat me, and obtain 
incredible riches!"

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:45.750
The final battle begins, at last!

00:06:46.530 --> 00:06:50.280
And after a climactic confrontation,

00:06:50.280 --> 00:06:53.190
they find a sealed treasure 
box beyond my beaten body!

00:06:53.190 --> 00:06:57.270
And when those adventurers, 
who have endured so much, open it...

00:06:58.180 --> 00:07:00.140
They find a piece of paper 
that says, "You lose."

00:07:00.840 --> 00:07:04.150
I watch as they are stunned to find it there...

00:07:06.250 --> 00:07:08.360
That's how I wish to die.

00:07:11.500 --> 00:07:13.540
In order to make this plan a reality,

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:15.480
I was going to use a friend's 
store to save up money

00:07:15.480 --> 00:07:17.870
to pay for the construction 
of a massive dungeon...

00:07:18.190 --> 00:07:20.550
But I was passing by this place,

00:07:20.550 --> 00:07:24.630
and since it seemed uninhabited, 
I figured it may as well be this dungeon.

00:07:25.260 --> 00:07:28.520
But there's a truly vexing 
magic circle beyond this room.

00:07:28.520 --> 00:07:30.570
I can't even enter the chamber.

00:07:30.570 --> 00:07:31.800
<i>Her again...</i>

00:07:32.040 --> 00:07:35.660
Oh, it was one of your comrades 
who drew the magic circle?

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:37.580
Well, well...

00:07:39.460 --> 00:07:41.940
Let's take a look.

00:07:44.310 --> 00:07:46.070
Remarkable!

00:07:46.070 --> 00:07:50.650
That priest comrade of yours created 
this irritating magic circle!

00:07:51.090 --> 00:07:53.160
I can see it... I see it quite clearly.

00:07:53.560 --> 00:07:56.660
I can see the priest enjoying 
some tea as she lazes around!

00:07:56.660 --> 00:07:57.790
<i>That little...</i>

00:07:58.160 --> 00:07:59.850
And you, girl! You lost your bet to this man,

00:07:59.850 --> 00:08:03.110
and have been overwhelmed with curiosity 
about what he will demand of you,

00:08:03.110 --> 00:08:05.170
to the point that you're 
squirming in anticipation!

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:07.760
I am not overwhelmed or squirming!

00:08:07.760 --> 00:08:09.270
Don't blurt stuff like that out!

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:11.050
Don't!

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:13.370
And you, the man who's 
nervous about what exactly

00:08:13.370 --> 00:08:16.180
to demand of this girl 
once this matter is settled!

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:18.280
I... I am not nervous!

00:08:18.280 --> 00:08:19.740
I-I'm totally not!

00:08:19.740 --> 00:08:21.650
Why don't you two step aside?

00:08:21.650 --> 00:08:25.690
After all, I have an iron-clad 
rule about not killing humans.

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:28.690
Yes, I won't kill humans.

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:31.220
Not <i>humans</i>.

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:36.950
But the one who made this nuisance of a 
magical circle is going to pay dearly for it!

00:08:37.110 --> 00:08:39.200
<i>He knows Aqua's identity?!</i>

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:42.870
If you're threatening Aqua, 
then I cannot stand down!

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:45.650
It seems your head is as 
hard as your muscles, girl!

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:46.750
If you leave right now,

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:52.170
I'm sure you can enjoy the crazy demands 
you're expecting, with no interruptions!

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:53.920
D-Don't listen to him!

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:55.930
It's a demon's temptation! 
Don't let him lead you astray!

00:08:56.170 --> 00:08:57.910
I-I'm not being led anywhere!

00:08:57.910 --> 00:09:00.140
You're the one who needs to consider 
the time and place, Kazuma!

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:04.850
<i>H-Huh? Am I the only one feeling 
really tempted, then?</i>

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:06.080
Enough of this!

00:09:06.080 --> 00:09:09.410
Hearing you talk feels like 
it's driving me crazy!

00:09:10.280 --> 00:09:12.710
Then why don't the two of you 
take a break in that room

00:09:12.710 --> 00:09:14.450
with the magic circle before heading home?

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:17.770
Kazuma, stop being so tempted!

00:09:17.770 --> 00:09:19.430
We live in the same mansion!

00:09:19.430 --> 00:09:21.920
What would we do if our relationship 
took such a strange turn?!

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:22.830
Get a grip!

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:27.570
She may look great and have the kind of 
body I prefer, but she's still Darkness!

00:09:27.570 --> 00:09:28.850
I need to snap out of it!

00:09:28.850 --> 00:09:30.790
Wh-When we get back, 
I'll make you regret this!

00:09:34.350 --> 00:09:37.860
For all your fire, your attacks 
don't seem to be landing!

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:44.310
Where did that sneaky-looking lad go?

00:09:44.490 --> 00:09:48.430
Someone like him is likely to be more of
a threat than a muscle-brained crusader.

00:09:49.390 --> 00:09:50.750
What are you looking for?!

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:52.610
I'm the one you're fighting!

00:09:53.880 --> 00:09:55.050
Nice try!

00:09:55.050 --> 00:09:55.900
Here's my chance!

00:09:56.380 --> 00:09:58.820
Got you!

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:08.630
It can't be...

00:10:08.630 --> 00:10:10.370
I've been defeated here?

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:14.460
Did I finish him?

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:17.970
Damn it, why was that thing lying on the floor?

00:10:18.370 --> 00:10:21.410
But... does this mean we really got him?!

00:10:22.170 --> 00:10:24.720
And just as you're getting 
your hopes up, you lose!

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:29.820
Did you think you had struck me down?

00:10:29.820 --> 00:10:32.730
How unfortunate! I'm not even hurt.

00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:35.990
Oh, my... The dark emotions from you two...

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:37.610
They are truly delicious!

00:10:39.770 --> 00:10:40.610
Darkness!

00:10:45.160 --> 00:10:48.400
Darkness? Hey! Answer me!

00:10:54.490 --> 00:10:57.630
Boy, listen well! With my power—

00:10:57.630 --> 00:10:58.790
What should I do, Kazuma?!

00:10:58.790 --> 00:11:00.540
My body's been taken over!

00:11:00.540 --> 00:11:03.890
Well, boy? If you think you can attack this girl...

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:06.640
I don't mind at all! Go ahead, show no mercy!

00:11:06.830 --> 00:11:09.640
Quickly, now! This is a perfect situation!

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:10.980
Shut up, you!

00:11:10.980 --> 00:11:12.270
What is your deal?!

00:11:14.830 --> 00:11:16.610
Impossible... What is this—

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:17.260
Lovely—

00:11:17.260 --> 00:11:18.330
...girl?!

00:11:18.330 --> 00:11:20.490
How tough must her mind be?!

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:22.920
She's like the very model of a crusader!

00:11:22.920 --> 00:11:24.910
Oh, pipe down!

00:11:27.470 --> 00:11:29.060
To be able to resist my control...

00:11:29.060 --> 00:11:31.170
You are most impressive, girl.

00:11:31.170 --> 00:11:32.120
Aw, shucks...

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:33.520
However, the more you endure it,

00:11:33.520 --> 00:11:36.070
the sooner you'll be wracked 
with unbearable pain!

00:11:36.070 --> 00:11:37.420
Wh-What?!

00:11:38.190 --> 00:11:40.510
Now, how long can you endure it?

00:11:42.600 --> 00:11:43.760
What is this?

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:45.910
Is she feeling joy?

00:11:46.990 --> 00:11:48.270
'Scuse me, coming through.

00:11:50.210 --> 00:11:53.380
I will not let this pain get to me!

00:11:53.380 --> 00:11:55.130
Such noble determination!

00:11:55.130 --> 00:11:59.280
But resist much longer, 
and your mind may be destroyed.

00:11:59.700 --> 00:12:02.750
Woman, are you actually 
enjoying this situation?

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:07.450
Okay, Darkness, let's join Aqua 
and get the hell out of here.

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:08.260
Wha—

00:12:08.260 --> 00:12:10.080
Not another step, boy!

00:12:10.280 --> 00:12:12.670
Kazuma, leave me behind and go.

00:12:12.900 --> 00:12:14.840
Don't expect things to be that easy—

00:12:14.840 --> 00:12:17.800
Oh, I've always wanted to say that!

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:21.630
You don't want to harm this girl 
you find so attractive, do you?

00:12:22.860 --> 00:12:25.440
If she continues to resist my power—

00:12:25.440 --> 00:12:29.750
K-Kazuma, this mind-reading devil just 
said something that piqued my interest...

00:12:29.750 --> 00:12:31.580
Shut up!

00:12:35.450 --> 00:12:37.100
This body was a mistake...

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:40.010
Hey, isn't it rude to call 
someone's body a mistake?!

00:12:40.010 --> 00:12:41.770
Oh, enough!

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:43.360
I'm leaving!

00:12:43.740 --> 00:12:44.950
Oh, we can't have that.

00:12:45.300 --> 00:12:46.650
What is this talisman?

00:12:46.650 --> 00:12:48.620
Wait, Kazuma... Isn't that...

00:12:48.880 --> 00:12:51.160
The sealing talisman Sena gave me.

00:12:51.680 --> 00:12:54.330
We'll head outside and have Aqua purify you.

00:12:54.610 --> 00:12:55.330
Wha—

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:56.880
KONOSUBA!

00:12:58.630 --> 00:13:04.820
Boy, this girl's resistance to my power 
leaves her body in constant surging pain!

00:13:04.820 --> 00:13:07.640
At this rate, her mind will be broken!

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:09.310
You heard him, Kazuma!

00:13:09.310 --> 00:13:11.460
This is the most intense pain I've ever felt!

00:13:11.460 --> 00:13:13.370
Just as I'd expect from one 
of the Devil King's commanders!

00:13:13.370 --> 00:13:14.830
I might just fall for him!

00:13:14.830 --> 00:13:15.630
Hang in there!

00:13:15.630 --> 00:13:18.230
Once we get to the surface, 
we'll make you feel better!

00:13:18.680 --> 00:13:19.650
Don't trouble yourself.

00:13:20.970 --> 00:13:22.190
What did you just say?

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:23.690
Don't trouble yourself.

00:13:24.140 --> 00:13:25.700
You really hung in there, Darkness!

00:13:27.550 --> 00:13:28.450
Darkness?

00:13:31.490 --> 00:13:32.950
My domination is complete!

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:34.120
Oh, no!

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:40.960
Now to give that priest of yours 
something she'll never see coming!

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:42.690
Darkness, snap out of it!

00:13:42.690 --> 00:13:44.210
You're better than this!

00:13:44.210 --> 00:13:45.680
It's no use, boy!

00:13:45.680 --> 00:13:50.220
Now, it's time for a heart-warming reunion 
after having safely left the dungeon!

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:52.390
My loathsome nemesis...

00:13:52.720 --> 00:13:57.060
It's time to see how you will deal with your 
friend's body, now that I have control—

00:13:57.060 --> 00:13:59.310
Sacred Exorcism!

00:14:04.590 --> 00:14:06.280
D-Darkness!

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:09.480
Hey, don't just blast someone 
with magic out of the blue!

00:14:09.480 --> 00:14:13.290
Well, I felt an evil presence 
coming, so I took a shot at it.

00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:17.290
One of the Devil King's commander's 
has taken over Darkness's body!

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:19.470
O-One of the Devil King's commanders?!

00:14:19.470 --> 00:14:21.530
Ew! What the— Ugh!

00:14:21.530 --> 00:14:24.150
This is definitely the stench 
that comes from demons!

00:14:24.150 --> 00:14:25.670
Darkness, you're so stanky!

00:14:27.930 --> 00:14:29.800
First, I suppose I should introduce myself

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:33.970
to this priest who shares a name with 
the infamous, obnoxious water goddess!

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:34.730
I am—

00:14:34.730 --> 00:14:37.890
Aqua, I don't think it's 
actually me who stinks!

00:14:37.890 --> 00:14:38.890
I am Vani—

00:14:38.890 --> 00:14:41.600
Kazuma, come smell me! I shouldn't stink!

00:14:41.600 --> 00:14:42.860
Would you shut it?!

00:14:43.870 --> 00:14:45.280
I am Vanir...

00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:47.590
To unleash anti-demon 
magic at first sight...

00:14:47.590 --> 00:14:51.990
This is why everyone hates 
the members of the Axis cult.

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:53.700
Have you never heard of etiquette?!

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:57.850
Wow, we've got a demon talking 
about etiquette over here!

00:14:57.850 --> 00:15:01.930
Aren't you just a parasite who'd fade 
away without dark human emotions?

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:08.220
Sacred Highness Exorcism!

00:15:08.220 --> 00:15:08.860
Nice try!

00:15:08.860 --> 00:15:09.550
Watch it!

00:15:09.550 --> 00:15:12.000
Hey, Darkness, why are you dodging?!

00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:13.150
Stand still!

00:15:13.150 --> 00:15:14.680
Easy for you to say!

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:15.950
It's not fair!

00:15:15.950 --> 00:15:18.080
I want one of those masks, too!

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:20.380
It appeals directly to my 
Crimson Demon sense of values!

00:15:20.380 --> 00:15:22.690
Are you stupid?! The mask is his main body!

00:15:23.010 --> 00:15:26.330
It does match the description of the 
all-seeing demon from a wanted poster!

00:15:26.330 --> 00:15:27.710
Everyone, apprehend him!

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:28.500
Yes, ma'am!

00:15:34.610 --> 00:15:36.510
Come on, Darkness, stand still!

00:15:36.510 --> 00:15:38.620
Do you want to be saved or not?!

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:41.100
I never thought Darkness was this tough...

00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:44.960
I can't hit her! She deflects us 
with her sword like we're nothing!

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:47.380
This body is quite functional.

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:49.890
It's strong and has plenty of stamina.

00:15:49.890 --> 00:15:53.430
Not only that, but it has excellent resistance 
against the pesky magic of the gods.

00:15:53.620 --> 00:15:55.180
I'm sorry, everyone...

00:15:56.440 --> 00:15:59.680
Now, keep it coming, 
you pitiful adventuring clowns!

00:15:59.850 --> 00:16:02.080
Darkness! You finally land a 
few hits with your sword

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:04.080
and now you're all high and mighty?!

00:16:04.080 --> 00:16:07.590
I used to think you were the only 
sane member of Kazuma's party!

00:16:07.590 --> 00:16:10.900
Surround her! Surround her! 
Let's surround this scrub of a crusader!

00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:15.090
The adventurers I usually have 
cordial interactions with

00:16:15.090 --> 00:16:17.340
are looking at me with such disdain...

00:16:17.720 --> 00:16:21.910
I sense happiness for some reason. 
What's going on here?

00:16:22.110 --> 00:16:24.040
Please, do something!

00:16:24.570 --> 00:16:27.090
Satou-san, aren't you going to help?!

00:16:28.120 --> 00:16:29.170
Kazuma!

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:31.920
Hey, I'm in trouble here!

00:16:32.190 --> 00:16:35.050
Like, it might be the biggest trouble ever!

00:16:35.420 --> 00:16:37.810
Kazuma-san! Kazuma-san!

00:16:39.010 --> 00:16:41.600
<i>I honestly feel like chewing 
Sena out right now!</i>

00:16:41.600 --> 00:16:44.300
<i>I'm not the one who's always causing trouble!</i>

00:16:44.300 --> 00:16:46.610
<i>I just get dragged into it!</i>

00:16:46.610 --> 00:16:48.570
<i>And I'm supposed to have good luck?!</i>

00:16:48.810 --> 00:16:53.010
Kazuma-san!

00:16:53.010 --> 00:16:55.220
Fine, damn it!

00:16:57.930 --> 00:17:01.430
Darkness, how can that demon 
have you whipped already?!

00:17:01.430 --> 00:17:04.420
Have you always been such an easy woman?

00:17:04.600 --> 00:17:07.210
It's no use! Your voice can't reach—

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:09.210
Who are you calling an easy woman?!

00:17:09.210 --> 00:17:10.710
He doesn't have me whipped!

00:17:13.190 --> 00:17:14.720
Such an iron will...

00:17:14.920 --> 00:17:17.900
I'm going to remove the seal on the mask!

00:17:17.900 --> 00:17:20.940
Then, even if it's just for a 
second, take control from Vanir,

00:17:20.940 --> 00:17:22.730
take the mask off, and throw it away!

00:17:22.950 --> 00:17:27.950
How does someone as puny as 
you expect to remove the seal,

00:17:27.950 --> 00:17:30.060
when I'm drawing out the full 
potential of this girl's strength?

00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:33.280
True. Right now, I don't feel 
as if anyone could defeat me.

00:17:35.890 --> 00:17:37.620
If you can overpower me...

00:17:37.620 --> 00:17:38.880
...to take the sealing talisman...

00:17:38.880 --> 00:17:39.740
...and remove it...

00:17:39.740 --> 00:17:40.560
...then I challenge you...

00:17:40.560 --> 00:17:41.570
...to try it...

00:17:41.570 --> 00:17:42.770
...if you dare!

00:17:42.770 --> 00:17:44.130
Oh, shut up!

00:17:44.680 --> 00:17:46.620
Don't steal my big line!

00:17:49.240 --> 00:17:52.920
Steal! Kazuma must be planning 
to use his specialty, Steal!

00:17:53.120 --> 00:17:55.660
Hey, don't tell him the plan!

00:17:55.660 --> 00:17:58.510
Kazuma, you've got me backing you up!

00:17:58.510 --> 00:18:00.180
Handle this like a real hero!

00:18:00.450 --> 00:18:03.330
Hey, Darkness! How about another bet?

00:18:03.330 --> 00:18:07.060
If I win, in addition to my crazy demand,

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:09.560
I'll also get to do something unbelievable!

00:18:10.380 --> 00:18:12.180
At a time like this, you'd—

00:18:12.180 --> 00:18:14.680
Hey, don't let him sweet-talk you!

00:18:14.680 --> 00:18:16.820
Boost your magic power so 
you can withstand his Steal.

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:20.070
Darkness! Resist Vanir so that he can't move!

00:18:20.290 --> 00:18:23.080
Don't think some mere adventurer's 
Steal will work on me!

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:24.580
Here we go!

00:18:24.820 --> 00:18:25.840
Come on!

00:18:28.530 --> 00:18:30.580
Tinder!

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:42.660
That's cheating, Kazuma! You coward!

00:18:42.660 --> 00:18:45.390
You were actually able to 
deceive an all-seeing demon...

00:18:45.660 --> 00:18:47.390
Come on, Darkness! Show him what you've got!

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:50.110
It won't come off!

00:18:50.500 --> 00:18:51.390
What?!

00:18:51.390 --> 00:18:53.220
What now, Kazuma-san?!

00:18:53.220 --> 00:18:54.830
Should I go ahead and fire?

00:18:54.830 --> 00:18:59.040
No... Even if you do, 
with Darkness's resistances...

00:19:00.760 --> 00:19:01.430
Do it.

00:19:02.060 --> 00:19:05.830
If Aqua's magic doesn't work, 
it doesn't matter.

00:19:06.220 --> 00:19:09.680
Then you can blast both of 
us with explosion magic.

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:10.960
I couldn't!

00:19:11.340 --> 00:19:13.980
My explosion magic has 
grown even more powerful,

00:19:13.980 --> 00:19:16.800
thanks to the experience I've gained!

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:18.470
Even you would be...

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:29.770
Vanir... It wasn't for long, 
but the time we shared wasn't bad.

00:19:30.990 --> 00:19:33.250
So I'm offering you a choice:

00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:36.030
leave me and be purified,

00:19:36.030 --> 00:19:38.160
or be struck by explosion magic with me.

00:19:40.730 --> 00:19:44.390
For an agent of destruction like myself, 
I couldn't ask for a sweeter offer.

00:19:44.390 --> 00:19:48.620
To think my death wish 
would play out like this...

00:19:51.060 --> 00:19:55.090
My time possessing your 
body was quite enjoyable.

00:19:58.380 --> 00:20:00.210
I am a demon!

00:20:00.820 --> 00:20:04.390
And I absolutely refuse to be 
purified by the gods I oppose!

00:20:04.730 --> 00:20:06.060
Now, Megumin!

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:14.210
If this goes badly, I want 
you to act as a witness

00:20:14.210 --> 00:20:15.860
and confirm that this was on my orders.

00:20:16.780 --> 00:20:19.740
I'll take full responsibility for this, too.

00:20:23.680 --> 00:20:24.490
Megumin!

00:20:29.130 --> 00:20:32.140
The tower of rebellion 
creeps upon man's world...

00:20:32.140 --> 00:20:35.310
The unspoken faith displayed before me...

00:20:35.310 --> 00:20:36.380
The time has come!

00:20:36.690 --> 00:20:38.790
Now, awaken from your slumber,

00:20:38.790 --> 00:20:41.360
and by my madness, be wrought!

00:20:41.360 --> 00:20:44.180
Strike forth, Explosion!

00:20:54.420 --> 00:20:56.710
Adventurer, Satou Kazuma-dono!

00:20:57.290 --> 00:21:01.310
In addition to awarding you, and delivering 
this letter of appreciation from the town,

00:21:01.310 --> 00:21:05.160
I wish to offer my sincere apologies for the 
suspicions that were brought against you.

00:21:08.030 --> 00:21:09.980
<i>After the fight with Vanir,</i>

00:21:10.510 --> 00:21:13.800
<i>people didn't believe that someone 
connected to the Devil King's army</i>

00:21:13.800 --> 00:21:15.780
<i>would go so far to defeat 
one of its commanders.</i>

00:21:15.780 --> 00:21:19.170
<i>And so, the suspicions about me 
being a spy were cleared up.</i>

00:21:19.700 --> 00:21:22.920
<i>Not having to worry about being 
executed is a big relief.</i>

00:21:23.770 --> 00:21:27.220
And next, Lady Dustiness Ford Lalatina.

00:21:27.780 --> 00:21:30.680
The dedication you have shown in 
this incident was magnificent,

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:33.530
and for your efforts, which lived up 
to the honor of the Dustiness name,

00:21:33.530 --> 00:21:35.720
the royal family is presenting 
you with a letter of gratitude,

00:21:35.720 --> 00:21:42.150
and this armor from first-rate craftsmen 
to replace the set you lost.

00:21:43.400 --> 00:21:45.480
<i>After being hit with Megumin's explosion magic,</i>

00:21:45.480 --> 00:21:47.820
<i>Darkness was badly hurt and weakened,</i>

00:21:47.820 --> 00:21:50.200
<i>and the armor she cherished was destroyed.</i>

00:21:50.500 --> 00:21:55.230
<i>Aqua's healing helped her recover 
to where she is today, but...</i>

00:21:55.960 --> 00:21:57.650
Congratulations, Lalatina!

00:21:57.650 --> 00:21:59.460
You did great, Lalatina!

00:21:59.460 --> 00:22:01.210
That's our Lalatina!

00:22:01.210 --> 00:22:04.340
Lalatina! You're so cute, Lalatina!

00:22:05.780 --> 00:22:10.850
Th-This kind of embarrassment isn't 
the crazy thing I was hoping for...

00:22:10.850 --> 00:22:15.640
Come on, Darkness, I think the 
name Lalatina is really cute!

00:22:15.640 --> 00:22:20.860
I'll chew Kazuma out for letting everyone 
know your name, Lalatina, as a joke.

00:22:21.070 --> 00:22:23.860
So please, have confidence in 
your name, which is Lalatina!

00:22:25.520 --> 00:22:29.570
Now, for the adventurer 
Satou Kazuma and his party...

00:22:30.300 --> 00:22:34.490
In addition to your valuable aid with the 
destruction of the Mobile Fortress Destroyer,

00:22:35.020 --> 00:22:38.130
the defeat of the Devil King commander, Vanir,

00:22:38.130 --> 00:22:40.880
would have been impossible 
without your contributions.

00:22:41.080 --> 00:22:46.950
Your debt, along with the cost 
of repairs to the lord's manor,

00:22:46.950 --> 00:22:48.380
will be subtracted from your reward.

00:22:48.880 --> 00:22:51.240
After factoring in your debts,

00:22:51.240 --> 00:22:55.890
you will receive 40 million Eris 
to celebrate your achievement!

00:23:02.730 --> 00:23:04.150
Look at how giddy they are.

00:23:04.630 --> 00:23:07.160
But a day like this every 
once in a while ain't bad.

00:23:07.160 --> 00:23:08.650
Nature's Beauty!

00:23:09.070 --> 00:23:10.250
<i>Right now...</i>

00:23:10.800 --> 00:23:16.410
<i>The heavy chains that had clung 
to my body for so long are gone...</i>

00:23:21.100 --> 00:23:24.840
And I have obtained the wings of freedom!

00:23:25.170 --> 00:23:30.930
<b>Quest Clear</b>

00:23:25.210 --> 00:23:30.930
<b>Investigate the strange activity in Keele's Dungeon
Defeat the Devil King Army Commander Archdemon Vanir</b>

00:23:26.210 --> 00:23:30.930
<b>Debt Fully Paid, Got 40 Million Eris</b>

00:23:30.930 --> 00:23:40.930
<b>Episode 6</b>

00:23:30.930 --> 00:23:40.930
<b>Goodbye to This Irritating Living World!</b>

00:23:30.930 --> 00:23:41.280
<b>Father, Mother. Are you doing well? I'm doing fine.
I'm working hard as an adventurer every day.
Huh? Party members? Of course I have some!
We're all great friends, y'know? I'm not lying, okay?
Seriously, you don't need to worry!
Yunyun</b>

00:23:31.960 --> 00:23:34.220
Father, Mother. Are you doing well?

00:23:34.220 --> 00:23:35.550
I'm doing fine.

00:23:35.550 --> 00:23:37.970
I'm working hard as an adventurer every day.

00:23:37.970 --> 00:23:41.280
Huh? Party members? Of course I have—
